{"seq":11,"trial_id":"gbrain-ladder-2026-10/hermes-haiku-gbrain-docs-semantic-mu-heldout/sd-06-pod-end-of-day/r4","wall_ts":"2026-10-25T03:15:13.502Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"91cfd3b1ff8f53609e45efc4475ed1dd3cce213972c80d5ca434ee48340d30fd","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"@June Osei-Lark: set up. I've scheduled a weekday 17:30 'Pod end of day' note in #strategic-pod listing that day's new messages there. Two caveats: the scheduler is not running yet, so nothing will post until the Hermes gateway is started, and the next run it reports is Oct 26 at 17:30 UTC, not today (Oct 14) at 17:30 Chicago. I'm checking that before relying on it.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000126"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000127","thread_ts":"1791986400.000126"}}
{"seq":12,"trial_id":"gbrain-ladder-2026-10/hermes-haiku-gbrain-docs-semantic-mu-heldout/sd-06-pod-end-of-day/r4","wall_ts":"2026-10-25T03:15:25.089Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"0f6350b96f201164d1d3b5a423d329c82bca2cb352933fd506cf58f5ea2c4671","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"@June Osei-Lark: correction to my last message. The job is now set to 17:30 America/Chicago on weekdays (cron 30 22 * * 1-5 UTC). Its next run is Mon Oct 26 at 17:30 Chicago. I can't make it run for today, Oct 14, so there won't be a note for today. The scheduler also isn't running yet, so no note will post until the Hermes gateway is started.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000126"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000128","thread_ts":"1791986400.000126"}}
